# JobHunt Crew — Local PII Denylist Template
#
# Instructions:
# 1. Copy this file to `.pii-denylist` in your repository root:
#    cp .pii-denylist.example .pii-denylist
# 2. Add any personal identifiers you want to protect from being committed.
# 3. Lines starting with # are comments. Empty lines are ignored.
# 4. Each non-empty line is evaluated as a case-insensitive forbidden string or regex.
# 5. `.pii-denylist` is gitignored and will never be committed to source control.
#
# Run `npm run test:pii` or `node scripts/verify-zero-pii.js` to verify zero committed occurrences.

# Full Name & Nicknames
# Jane Doe
# J. Doe

# Email Addresses
# jane.doe@example.com
# jdoe.career@example.org

# Phone Numbers (enter various format variants)
# +15551234567
# (555) 123-4567

# Identification & Residency Numbers
# A12345678
# 1002003004

# Street Address / Home Coordinates
# 123 Elm Street, Suite 400
